WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,670
Coco I'm back

2
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:07,510
Come pick me up at the school gate

3
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:10,390
Sorry, Jingyi is back

4
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:12,110
Today we can only get here first

5
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,580
Coco, your knees are like this

6
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,260
How can I help her?

7
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,900
Wouldn't it be nice if she jumped back on her own?

8
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,020
It’s not like I’ve never sprained my feet

9
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,700
How can you be so squeamish?

10
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,940
These two people originally had a good impression of Song Jingyi.

11
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,540
But once people touch their own interests,

12
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,660
It is easy to be dissatisfied

13
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:27,620
Jingyi is afraid of pain

14
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,420
You probably don’t know about the wear and tear on my knees either.

15
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,660
I'm really sorry

16
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,350
I used to think Song Jingyi had a good heart

17
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:35,950
Don't actually care about Miko's appearance

18
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:37,070
And she is her best friend

19
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:38,910
But how do I feel now

20
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:41,070
She is using Teacher Mi as a press room.

21
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:43,310
How could he not know that Teacher Mi had an old knee injury?

22
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:45,870
Song Jingyi just puts her own needs first and doesn't care

23
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:47,670
Uh, Jingyi’s foot is also injured.

24
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:49,670
It’s normal to think of your friends first when you have difficulties.

25
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:50,870
Are you too worried?

26
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:56,460
Why don't you go to the car?

27
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:59,440
Who is the handsome guy standing next to her and Song Xiahua?
